From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Roman Leventov <leventov.ru@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 00:54:09 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 26/28] node-executor: supervise deployment-selected native
 residents

Bind immutable executable and configuration digests to the committed root source package, compare expected prior selection, and expose transactional deployment metadata for application ownership checks. Retain the newest empty package as deployment authority.

Supervise inert preparation, activation, progress and bounded retirement with one native steady slot and the existing shared Node replacement surge owner. Keep process, verified artifact and capacity ownership through cancellation, force, memory pressure and shutdown until direct-child reaping is confirmed.

Add administrative preparation and inspection, publication compatibility guards, durable reconciliation, actual executable lifecycle tests and generic operator adoption documentation.
